            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the spotlight as the new manager of a struggling burlesque theatre.<br>Restore the venue. Recruit dazzling performers. Build relationships. Put on unforgettable shows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Burlesque</strong>, you’re not just running a theatre, you’re shaping the future of an entire troupe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance finances, train dancers, keep the building presentable and deepen personal connections as you transform a fading venue into the most talked-about attraction in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage the Theatre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up weekly performances and improve show quality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage money, energy, and time across each day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase ticket sales through better performances and promotion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your troupe and unlock new headliners</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stronger theatre means bigger crowds and bigger profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Troupe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dancer has her own personality, ambitions, and story.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk, flirt, and bond with performers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give thoughtful gifts to improve relationships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share meals to deepen trust</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock special events as your connection grows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover personal story arcs for every dancer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stronger bonds lead to better performances and unforgettable nights on stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living Daily System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your time wisely:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train dancers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean and improve the theatre</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go shopping for gifts or outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare meals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger special character events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
